@startuml
title 情境三：GIF 動畫工作坊之畫布擷取、多視窗 IPC 廣播與匯出流程
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "使用者" as User
participant "主視窗 (App)" as MainWin
participant "TauriBridge" as Bridge
participant "Tauri 後端核心\n(lib.rs)" as TauriCore
participant "AppState\n(Mutex)" as State
participant "GIF 工作坊視窗\n(GifStudioWindow)" as GifWin
participant "gif_ops\n(動畫編碼器)" as GifOps
participant "作業系統檔案系統" as OS

User -> MainWin : 點擊「擷取目前畫布為 GIF 影格」
activate MainWin
MainWin -> MainWin : getMergedCompositeDataUrl()\n合成 BaseCanvas 與 DrawingCanvas
MainWin -> Bridge : invokeAddSharedGifFrame(frameItem)
activate Bridge
Bridge -> TauriCore : invoke("add_shared_gif_frame", { frame })
activate TauriCore

TauriCore -> State : inner.lock().shared_frames.push(frame)
activate State
deactivate State

TauriCore -> TauriCore : app_handle.emit("gif_frame_added", &frame)
note over TauriCore : 向所有 Webview 廣播影格新增事件

TauriCore --> Bridge : 回傳目前影格總數
deactivate TauriCore
Bridge --> MainWin : Promise.resolve(count)
deactivate Bridge

MainWin -> Bridge : invokeOpenGifStudio()
activate Bridge
Bridge -> TauriCore : invoke("open_gif_studio_window")
activate TauriCore
TauriCore -> GifWin : 顯示並聚焦獨立工作坊視窗
deactivate TauriCore
deactivate Bridge
deactivate MainWin

activate GifWin
GifWin -> GifWin : 收到 "gif_frame_added" 事件監聽回呼
GifWin -> GifWin : setFrames(prev => [...prev, newFrame])
note over GifWin : 時間軸即時加入新縮圖，預覽動態循環播放

User -> GifWin : 調整時間軸次序、設定延遲 120ms\n點擊「匯出動態 GIF」按鈕
GifWin -> Bridge : pickSavePath("animation.gif", ...)
activate Bridge
Bridge -> OS : 開啟儲存檔案對話框
activate OS
OS --> Bridge : 回傳選定路徑 "C:/Images/output.gif"
deactivate OS
Bridge --> GifWin : savePath
deactivate Bridge

GifWin -> Bridge : invokeExportGif(options, savePath)
activate Bridge
Bridge -> TauriCore : invoke("export_gif", { options, file_path })
activate TauriCore

TauriCore -> GifOps : create_gif_bytes(&options)
activate GifOps
note over GifOps : 1. 計算目標尺寸 (crop / min_fit)\n2. 串流編碼 Frame (NeuQuant + 延遲)\n3. 設定循環次數 Repeat::Infinite
GifOps --> TauriCore : 回傳 Vec<u8> 二進位位元組
deactivate GifOps

TauriCore -> OS : std::fs::write(&file_path, bytes)
activate OS
OS --> TauriCore : 寫入成功
deactivate OS
TauriCore --> Bridge : Ok("成功匯出 GIF")
deactivate TauriCore
Bridge --> GifWin : 匯出完成回傳
deactivate Bridge

GifWin -> User : 顯示綠色成功通知徽章
deactivate GifWin

@enduml
